# Google service-account credentials (DO NOT COMMIT — private key material).
# The project loads these via ``GCP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE`` env var. The
# broad patterns below catch common naming variants so a renamed file
# stays out of the repo even if someone runs ``git add .`` without filter.
gcp_service_account*.json
google_service_account*.json
*_service_account.json
*service-account-key*.json

